  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2102.02 Definitions. “Exhaust and ventilation system” means any system that removes and transports particulate matter from the point of generation to the ambient air.\n\nSource. #8215, eff 11-24-04 (from Env-A 2103); ss by #10314, eff 4-23-13; ss by #13693, eff 7-22-23",
